{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51264","headline":"钓滩（一作「台」） · 李白","name":"钓滩（一作「台」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"磨尽石岭墨，浔阳钓赤鱼。\n霭峯尖似笔，堪画不堪书。\n（《舆地纪胜》二十《徽州》有此诗，注称在黟县南十八里，相传太白游新安，尝钓於此，作诗云云。\n《九域志》、《锦绣万花谷》、《一统志》皆引「霭峯尖似笔」之句，以爲太白诗。\n康熙《徽州府志》二《山川》引此诗，「石岭墨」作「石墨岭」，「笔」作「削」。\n〖王琦《李太白诗集注》卷三十疑此诗或爲南唐另翰林学士李白作。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}